@media
# prose-audit: Grade A — A focused Lewica briefing and voiced aftermaths turn media capacity into an organisational choice.
title: A campaign without an ecosystem
new-page: true
on-arrival: media_event_done = 1; news_headline = "The Left discovers how little media it owns"

= January 2020 — A campaign without an ecosystem

Public television speaks for PiS; commercial news reduces politics to PiS
against KO. We can still place good guests, but we have no daily operation to
turn a report from Wałbrzych or Elbląg into tomorrow's national argument.

- @media_newsroom
- @media_subscription
- @media_personalities
- @media_wait

@media_newsroom
title: Fund a campaign newsroom and rapid-response team
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Slow-looking, durable capacity.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; media_strategy = "Professional network"; media_relationship = "Owned newsroom and trained guest network"; media_capacity += 12; local_network += 3; public_trust += 2; news_headline = "A small newsroom begins to contest the first frame"

We hire researchers and producers, train our guests and give regional contacts
somewhere to send a story. There is no grand launch. The candidate simply
stops discovering the day's hostile question on air.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@media_subscription
title: Build the operation around subscriptions and a membership drive
subtitle: +1 resource and modest reach. Organisers spend the month asking the same supporters twice.
on-arrival: resources += 1; media_strategy = "Supporter subscription"; media_relationship = "Supporter-funded mailing and video operation"; media_capacity += 4; local_network += 2; organiser_energy -= 4; young_support += 1; barons_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Subscriptions finance a small Left media operation"

Our appeal produces recurring donors and a mailing list we control. It does
not produce enough reporters to answer every hostile broadcast.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@media_personalities
title: Put everything behind recognisable personalities
subtitle: Immediate reach; the organisation remains hollow.
on-arrival: media_strategy = "Leader-led campaign"; media_relationship = "Leader access without owned distribution"; media_capacity += 5; left_poll += 0.4; spring_strength += 2; barons_dissent += 3; public_trust -= 1; news_headline = "The candidate becomes the entire media strategy"

Bookings increase, but every success now belongs to the candidate—and so does
every mistake. Our local candidates wait for material that never arrives.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@media_wait
title: Save the money for the formal campaign
subtitle: Resources survive; hostile frames compound.
on-arrival: media_strategy = "Reactive"; media_relationship = "Reactive bookings and borrowed audiences"; media_capacity -= 2; left_poll -= 0.3; public_trust -= 2; news_headline = "The Left again answers yesterday's story"

We preserve the treasury and leave the press office answering yesterday's
story. By the formal campaign, our opponents have already chosen the frame.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@covid
