= March 2020 — The first lockdown

Schools close, borders tighten and hospitals begin to reorganise. PiS asks us
for national unity while avoiding the constitutional state of natural disaster
that would postpone the presidential election. We must answer both the danger
in the wards and the abuse hidden in the calendar.

- @covid_social
- @covid_legal
- @covid_unity
- @covid_liberty

@covid_social
title: Support restrictions only with a worker and care guarantee
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. The broadest Left response.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources to organise the package.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; covid_policy = "Restrictions with a social shield"; health_policy_pressure += 6; household_policy_pressure += 7; labor_credibility += 7; public_trust += 4; covid_anti_system_pressure -= 3; pis_solidarist_share += 2; pis_market_hardliner_share -= 2; ko_social_liberal_share += 2; ko_classical_liberal_share -= 2; pis_relation -= 2; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "The lockdown debate turns toward work and care"

We back necessary health measures and demand paid sick leave, wage replacement,
hospital money and protection from eviction. Employers attack the price; a
worker sent home without wages can explain why we chose it.

- @poland_hub: Govern from opposition

@covid_legal
title: Demand a constitutional state of natural disaster
subtitle: Protects electoral law; sounds remote from household fear.
on-arrival: covid_policy = "Constitutional emergency"; constitutional_restraint += 9; judicial_legitimacy += 4; ko_relation += 3; public_trust += 1; household_policy_pressure -= 2; covid_anti_system_pressure += 1; news_headline = "The Left makes the election calendar a constitutional issue"

Our legal case is strong and the government refuses it. People waiting for
income support hear much less about that part.

- @poland_hub: Govern from opposition

@covid_unity
title: Offer the government temporary national unity
subtitle: Immediate trust; PiS writes most of the terms.
on-arrival: covid_policy = "National unity"; pis_relation += 7; president_relation += 4; public_trust += 5; health_policy_pressure += 3; covid_anti_system_pressure -= 2; pis_solidarist_share += 2; pis_market_hardliner_share -= 2; party_unity -= 4; razem_dissent += 5; progressives_dissent += 3; last_policy_stage = "Advocacy"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "The opposition lowers its voice as the virus spreads"

Our gesture reassures frightened voters and lets the cabinet decide when the
emergency—and our silence—will end. Razem begins to count the concessions we
did not demand.

- @poland_hub: Govern from opposition

@covid_liberty
title: Oppose the lockdown as disproportionate
subtitle: A high-risk civil-libertarian and anti-system line.
on-arrival: covid_policy = "Opposition to lockdown"; constitutional_restraint += 2; health_policy_pressure -= 6; pandemic_deaths_pressure += 3; public_trust -= 8; left_poll -= 0.6; far_right_agenda += 8; covid_anti_system_pressure += 12; konf_org_resources += 2; konf_poll_momentum += 0.35; konf_braunist_share += 4; konf_mentzenite_share += 4; konf_nationalist_share -= 8; razem_dissent += 4; news_headline = "The Left enters an anti-lockdown field already owned by Konfederacja"

We expose restrictions that are badly grounded and poorly drafted, then lose
that distinction beside actors who deny the danger itself. Konfederacja takes
the recruits; we take responsibility for their argument.

- @poland_hub: Govern from opposition

@postal
# prose-audit: Grade A — Lewica's legal and electoral dilemma is immediate, and every route carries a distinct political owner and cost.
title: The postal election
new-page: true
on-arrival: postal_event_done = 1; news_headline = "PiS attempts a presidential election by post"

= April 2020 — The postal election

PiS prepares an improvised all-postal vote for May. Municipalities, the
electoral commission and Jarosław Gowin's faction all question whether a lawful
election can occur. We must defend the ballot without making our own candidate
disappear from it.

- @postal_front
- @postal_gowin
- @postal_boycott
- @postal_compete

@postal_front
title: Build one opposition legal and municipal front
subtitle: Requires both trust and institutional compatibility with KO.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 40 and ko_coalition_openness >= 42
unavailable-subtitle: KO will not yet put its mayors under a common command.
on-arrival: postal_election_stance = "Democratic legal front"; ko_relation += 7; judicial_legitimacy += 6; constitutional_restraint += 5; public_trust += 4; president_relation -= 4; media_capacity += 2; news_headline = "Mayors and opposition parties refuse an unlawful improvisation"

We join our lawyers to opposition mayors, preserve the evidence and demand a
lawful later vote. KO has to share the platform, and our candidate remains in
view rather than becoming a footnote to its mayors.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@postal_gowin
title: Help Gowin's revolt postpone the vote
subtitle: Effective but dependent on a conservative government dissenter.
on-arrival: postal_election_stance = "Gowin postponement bargain"; pis_relation += 4; ko_relation -= 2; public_trust += 3; party_unity -= 2; barons_dissent -= 2; progressives_dissent += 4; news_headline = "A crack inside the United Right stops the May vote"

We help Gowin deny PiS its majority. The vote is postponed through arithmetic,
not a clean constitutional settlement, and the conservative dissenter leaves
the room with ownership of the result.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@postal_boycott
title: Announce an unconditional boycott
subtitle: Clear illegitimacy claim; abandons the electoral field.
on-arrival: postal_election_stance = "Boycott"; progressive_credibility += 4; constitutional_restraint += 3; left_poll -= 0.5; media_capacity -= 2; ko_relation -= 3; news_headline = "The Left refuses the postal ballot"

Our refusal is clear enough for every voter to repeat. It is also difficult to
reverse when the date and procedure change and our candidate needs the field
we abandoned.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@postal_compete
title: Campaign as if the vote will occur
subtitle: Media capacity determines whether defiance looks prepared.
on-arrival: {!
Q.postal_election_stance = "Compete and litigate";
if (Q.media_capacity >= 25) {
    Q.left_poll += 0.6;
    Q.public_trust += 2;
    Q.presidential_campaign_bonus = (Q.presidential_campaign_bonus || 0) + 0.5;
    Q.news_headline = "The Left campaigns while challenging the rules";
} else {
    Q.left_poll -= 0.4;
    Q.public_trust -= 3;
    Q.presidential_campaign_bonus = (Q.presidential_campaign_bonus || 0) - 0.2;
    Q.news_headline = "A campaign without a ballot or a broadcast plan drifts";
}
!}

[? if media_capacity >= 25: We keep the legal objection clear while our digital
campaign reaches voters confined at home. Defiance looks like preparation, not
denial. ?]

[? if media_capacity < 25: We insist that we are competing, but cannot explain
how supporters should vote or why the procedure is legitimate. Defiance looks
like drift. ?]

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@shield
# prose-audit: Grade A — Excluded households anchor the briefing, and each rescue line names who gains a champion and who is left waiting.
title: Who receives the shield?
new-page: true
on-arrival: shield_event_done = 1; pandemic_deaths_pressure += 5; news_headline = "The shutdown becomes a household economic crisis"

= May 2020 — Who receives the shield?

The first emergency packages protect some jobs and firms while civil
contractors, carers, tenants and local services fall through the gaps. We have
the organisers and airtime to make one of those failures impossible to ignore.

- @shield_wages
- @shield_local
- @shield_enterprise
- @shield_maximal
- @shield_wait

@shield_wages
title: Make wage replacement, sick pay and rent the red line
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Opposition campaign pressure; no household benefit is implemented yet.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources to sustain the campaign.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; household_policy_pressure += 9; labor_credibility += 8; razem_dissent -= 4; left_poll += 0.4; budget_promises += 2; ko_relation += 2 if ko_accept_social >= 55; pis_relation += 2 if pis_accept_social >= 55; ko_social_liberal_share += 2 if ko_accept_social >= 55; pis_solidarist_share += 2 if pis_accept_social >= 55; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "The social shield acquires a Left edge"

We give workers and tenants a sentence they can use against the rescue figures:
no wage, no sick pay and no rent protection means no shield. In December they
will ask whether we funded the promise we taught them to repeat.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@shield_local
title: Protect local hospitals, councils and small firms
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Builds pressure and local allies; ministries still control implementation.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; health_policy_pressure += 5; local_network += 6; psl_relation += 5 if psl_accept_social >= 45; psl_relation += 2 if psl_accept_social < 45; household_policy_pressure += 4; barons_dissent -= 3; progressives_dissent += 2; budget_promises += 1; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Local survival becomes the opposition's test"

Hospital directors, mayors and small employers can carry our case in every
county. The alliance is practical, but it gives our PSL-minded regional wing a
network that may outlast the emergency.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@shield_enterprise
title: Suspend payroll charges and guarantee private emergency credit
subtitle: A capitalist rescue line builds a market caucus and angers Labour and Razem.
on-arrival: left_economic_position += 7; left_right_score += 4; market_liberal_support += 10; liberal_professionals_left_affinity += 3; public_trust += 1; barons_dissent -= 3; labor_dissent += 8; razem_dissent += 10; progressives_dissent += 4; household_policy_pressure -= 2; konf_poll_momentum -= 0.1; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Lewica makes private payroll survival its emergency red line"

We challenge the libertarian right on business survival and find a new audience
among owners and professionals. Labour and Razem answer that workers and
tenants now receive protection only through an employer or a bank.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@shield_maximal
title: Demand every protection without publishing the financing
subtitle: High salience, low fiscal credibility.
on-arrival: household_policy_pressure += 4; progressive_credibility += 3; labor_credibility += 3; public_trust -= 5; budget_promises += 4; barons_dissent += 3; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "A maximal shield wins applause and a costing attack"

Every excluded group hears its name from our rostrum. When journalists ask who
pays, we answer with another list, and the old guard sees a promise it will have
to defend in the next budget.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@shield_wait
title: Let PiS own the rescue and preserve party resources
subtitle: No campaign cost, but collapsing issue ownership.
on-arrival: household_policy_pressure -= 3; labor_credibility -= 5; left_poll -= 0.4; pis_relation += 2; opposition_budget_issue_ownership -= 3; news_headline = "PiS owns both the restrictions and the rescue"

We avoid an expensive campaign and let PiS become both the author and the critic
of state intervention. Our labour organisers are left explaining why the
parliamentary Left chose commentary over a demand.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

