# prose-audit: Grade A — The merger is presented as a struggle over programme, machinery and ownership, with faction-specific aftermaths.
title: What is Nowa Lewica?
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.merger_event_done = 1;
Q.razem_can_lead_merger =
    Q.razem_strength > Q.barons_strength &&
    Q.razem_strength > Q.spring_strength &&
    Q.razem_strength > Q.labor_strength &&
    Q.razem_strength > Q.progressives_strength &&
    Q.razem_strength > Q.pps_strength ? 1 : 0;
Q.news_headline = Q.razem_can_lead_merger
    ? "Razem challenges every Left wing to enter one party"
    : "SLD and Wiosna negotiate the new party";
!}

= September 2020 — What is Nowa Lewica?

SLD brings the legal shell and regional offices; Wiosna brings a national brand
that refuses to be swallowed by them. We must decide whether a common party
means one command or rules for living with separate currents. [? if razem_can_lead_merger: Razem now has enough weight to enter a single party—provided it writes the programme and takes the lead.?][? if not razem_can_lead_merger: Razem will not dissolve under another wing's chair. Our constitution must treat that autonomy as a fact, a betrayal or an invitation to rebuild the whole camp.?]

- @merger_all
- @merger_dual
- @merger_central
- @merger_assets
- @merger_convention

@merger_all
title: Merge every wing into a single Razem-led party
subtitle: Maximum integration; the old establishment and Wiosna lose command.
choose-if: razem_can_lead_merger = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Razem accepts a full merger only from first place, when it can force the lead.
on-arrival: nowa_lewica_merger_agreed = 1; razem_merged = 1; merger_leader = "Razem"; left_project = "Unified Razem-led Nowa Lewica"; left_party_name = "Lewica Razem"; party_unity += 10; razem_dissent -= 18; razem_cooperation += 20; razem_escalation_stage = 0; razem_grievance_memory = 0; razem_defection_readiness = 0; razem_demand_answered = 1; organiser_energy += 3; labor_credibility += 3; barons_dissent += 12; spring_dissent += 7; progressives_dissent += 3; news_headline = "Razem leads every Left wing into one party"

We accept Razem's programme and leadership in exchange for its legal escape
route. SLD and Wiosna sign the same statute, then begin organising as defeated
currents rather than dissolving into the winner.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter

@merger_dual
title: Protect SLD and Wiosna with dual leadership
subtitle: Historical architecture; peace today, postponed integration.
on-arrival: nowa_lewica_merger_agreed = 1; merger_leader = "Dual chairs"; left_project = "Nowa Lewica with SLD–Wiosna parity"; party_unity += 5; barons_dissent -= 5; spring_dissent -= 7; progressives_dissent += 1; razem_cooperation += 2; news_headline = "Nowa Lewica begins with two protected halves"

We protect both founders from immediate absorption. Every appointment now needs
two signatures, and every compromise rehearses the succession fight.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter

@merger_central
title: Centralise the new party around SLD machinery
subtitle: Efficient organisation; Spring and younger progressives lose trust.
on-arrival: nowa_lewica_merger_agreed = 1; merger_leader = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty"; left_project = "Centralised Nowa Lewica"; barons_strength += 7; barons_dissent -= 8; local_network += 4; spring_dissent += 12; progressives_dissent += 7; party_unity -= 5; news_headline = "The old machine writes the new rules"

We give the SLD executive a party that can make decisions before lunch. By
evening, Wiosna's most visible faces are asking whether they joined it or were
acquired by it.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter

@merger_assets
title: Consolidate SLD offices, leases and campaign accounts first
subtitle: +2 resources and a stronger machine. Wiosna and Razem see an asset takeover.
on-arrival: nowa_lewica_merger_agreed = 1; merger_leader = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty"; resources += 2; left_project = "Asset-led Nowa Lewica"; local_network += 4; barons_strength += 4; barons_dissent -= 5; spring_dissent += 10; progressives_dissent += 6; razem_dissent += 5; party_unity -= 4; public_trust -= 1; news_headline = "The merger begins with the old party's balance sheet"

We inherit rooms, equipment and solvent regional accounts. Wiosna and Razem
also receive a blunt answer to the question of who owns the merger.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter

@merger_convention
title: Convene a broader Left constituent convention
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Razem keeps legal autonomy but writes common rules.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources for a credible national process.
on-arrival: nowa_lewica_merger_agreed = 1; merger_leader = "Constituent convention"; resources -= 2; left_project = "Federated Left convention"; razem_cooperation += 10; razem_dissent -= 6; party_unity += 7; barons_dissent += 9; spring_dissent += 2; media_capacity += 2; news_headline = "The alliance writes rules larger than one party"

We write common-list, primary and dispute rules without pretending Razem has
dissolved. Members gain a way to settle the next conflict; SLD regional leaders
see an expensive machine they no longer fully control.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter

@abortion
